# Auth for the Many Hands Engineering loops: Claude subscription OAuth, never an
# API key. Generate with `claude setup-token`, then copy this file to
# `agents/.env` (gitignored) and paste the token.
#
# In a git worktree, the harness also falls back to a sibling project's
# `agents/.env`, so a single token set once is reused across projects.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
